    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "request-what-it-carries",
        "moduleId": "request-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：request 对象承载什么",
        "markdown": "教材指出，Flask 会在请求触发后把本次请求的信息放进 `request` 对象，可以从 `flask` 包导入它。这个对象汇集了请求路径（`request.path`）、请求方法（`request.method`）、表单数据（`request.form`）和查询字符串（`request.args`）等信息。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000063"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 7 章：表单",
                "请求对象"
              ],
              "lineStart": 429,
              "lineEnd": 433,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0745e39dfa503e227c2df2149931c7097091572d01e7b72af117dba514036995"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-submit-scenario",
        "moduleId": "request-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型补充：一次表单提交到底发生了什么",
        "markdown": "把主页表单的提交流程对照起来看：用户在输入框里填好标题和年份，点击提交后浏览器发出一个 POST 请求。视图函数此时要回答两个问题——这是不是一次 POST 提交，以及用户填的字段值是什么。`request` 就是这两类信息的入口：前者对应请求方法，后者对应表单字段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-what-it-carries"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-availability",
        "moduleId": "request-scope",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材：request 的可用范围",
        "markdown": "教材强调，`request` 只在请求触发时才会包含数据，因此只能在视图函数内部调用它。它依赖当前正在处理的这一次请求，而不是一个可以随时取用的全局常量。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000063"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 7 章：表单",
                "请求对象"
              ],
              "lineStart": 429,
              "lineEnd": 433,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0745e39dfa503e227c2df2149931c7097091572d01e7b72af117dba514036995"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-scope-discipline",
        "moduleId": "request-scope",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "模型补充：为什么只能在视图函数里使用",
        "markdown": "由此可以得到一条使用纪律：不要在模块顶层、应用启动阶段或后台线程中直接读取 `request`。这些位置没有当前请求可用，访问 `request` 的请求属性会失败。需要把请求数据传递给别的函数时，应在视图函数内先取出具体值，再作为参数传下去。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-availability"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-method-and-form",
        "moduleId": "read-method-form",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：判断请求方法并读取表单",
        "markdown": "教材给出的典型用法是：先通过 `request.method` 的值判断本次请求的方法；确认是 POST 之后，再用 `request.form` 获取表单数据。`request.form` 是一个特殊的字典，用表单字段的 `name` 属性值作为键，就能取到用户填入的对应数据。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000063"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 7 章：表单",
                "请求对象"
              ],
              "lineStart": 429,
              "lineEnd": 433,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0745e39dfa503e227c2df2149931c7097091572d01e7b72af117dba514036995"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-code-example",
        "moduleId": "read-method-form",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "模型补充：教材两步写法的完整代码",
        "markdown": "把教材里的两步合起来，视图函数可以写成下面的形式：\n\n```python\nfrom flask import request\n\n@app.route('/', methods=['GET', 'POST'])\ndef index():\n    if request.method == 'POST':\n        title = request.form['title']\n        year = request.form['year']\n        # 在这里保存 title 和 year\n    return render_template('index.html')\n```\n\n这里的 `title` 和 `year` 正是模板中两个输入框 `name` 属性的值，字段名两处必须一致，否则取不到数据。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-method-and-form"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-form-details",
        "moduleId": "read-method-form",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：request.form 的取值细节",
        "markdown": "`request.form` 是 Werkzeug 提供的多值字典（MultiDict），同名字段可以保存多个值。单值读取如 `request.form['title']` 在字段缺失时会抛出 `KeyError` 类型的错误；如果某个字段允许不填，可以改用 `request.form.get('year', '')` 提供默认值。需要一次取出同名复选框的全部取值时，使用 `request.form.getlist('genre')`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-method-and-form",
            "request-code-example"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-source-overview",
        "moduleId": "compare-request-sources",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "教材：request 中的几类信息",
        "markdown": "教材在同一处列出了 `request` 承载的几类信息：请求的路径（`request.path`）、请求的方法（`request.method`）、表单数据（`request.form`）和查询字符串（`request.args`）。它们描述的是同一次请求的不同侧面，但取值来源并不相同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000063"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 7 章：表单",
                "请求对象"
              ],
              "lineStart": 429,
              "lineEnd": 433,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0745e39dfa503e227c2df2149931c7097091572d01e7b72af117dba514036995"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-source-table",
        "moduleId": "compare-request-sources",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "模型补充：四类请求信息对照表",
        "markdown": "把这几类信息按来源对齐，可以避免在视图函数里取错对象：\n\n| 要获取的信息 | 属性 | 数据来源 | 典型场景 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 请求方法 | `request.method` | HTTP 请求行 | 区分 GET 渲染与 POST 提交 |\n| 表单字段 | `request.form` | 请求体（通常为 POST） | 读取用户填写的标题、年份 |\n| 查询参数 | `request.args` | URL 中 `?` 之后的查询字符串 | 读取搜索关键词、分页参数 |\n| 请求路径 | `request.path` | URL 的路径部分 | 记录访问路径或做路径判断 |\n\n例如用 POST 提交表单后去读 `request.args`，通常拿不到表单字段，因为这些字段在请求体里，不在查询字符串里。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-source-overview"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-check-exercise",
        "moduleId": "apply-and-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "模型补充：情境判断练习",
        "markdown": "一个搜索页用 GET 提交关键词 `q`，另一个新增条目表单用 POST 提交 `title` 和 `year`。请分别写出应该读取的属性，并说明先用哪个属性确认请求方法。\n\n参考答案：搜索页读 `request.args['q']`，新增表单读 `request.form['title']` 和 `request.form['year']`；两者都可以先用 `request.method` 判断请求方法，再进入对应分支处理。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-method-and-form",
            "request-source-table"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "request-summary-block",
        "moduleId": "apply-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "模型补充：本点小结与下一步",
        "markdown": "小结：`request` 在请求触发后由 Flask 提供，只能在有请求上下文的视图函数内使用；`request.method` 决定走哪条处理分支，`request.form` 读取 POST 表单字段，`request.args` 读取 URL 查询参数。取到数据之后，下一步通常是给用户一个操作反馈，这正是 flash 消息要解决的问题。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "request-check-exercise",
            "request-source-overview"
          ]
        }
      }
